{"level":30,"time":1776957922258,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_012v5Pkd8dUARjdBxSRaNJ1Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! Now I have key project information:\n- Project: Valley View Townhomes (SP-2025-0126C)\n- 39 townhome units on 2.16 acres\n- Demolished a prior assisted living facility - now vacant\n\nNow I need to determine applicability of the EL-1 grouping (overhead electric clearances). The checklist items require that \"overhead electric facilities exist on or adjacent to site\" for various features. Let me check Sheet 21 which is the \"Preliminary Electrical Design Plan\" to see if there are existing overhead electric facilities shown.\n\nActually, the grouping is applicable if:\n1. There are overhead electric facilities on or adjacent to the site\n2. There are proposed site features that need to maintain clearances\n\nLet me check the electrical design plan and any utility plans that show existing overhead facilities.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8303,"cache_read_input_tokens":31907,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8303},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"86ce6d80-0b13-4282-a0c1-971fcaa319e8","uuid":"bb276df9-4377-4fd0-b29f-87afd5fced27"}
