ee (M) symbol in lower right area\"},{\"objectA\":\"OHE conductor line along southern boundary\",\"objectB\":\"nearest mitigation or other tree in bottom-right area\"}]' --scaleInchesPerFoot='0.05'","msg":"Executing typed script tool"}
{"level":30,"time":1776958245568,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01C66gc8nUQ5X1eQpqLstPFE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! So the vision analysis confirms that there ARE existing overhead utility poles and lines shown on the Existing Conditions Survey (Sheet 4). Specifically:\n- 3 poles along Valley View Road (southwestern, midway, and northwestern corners)\n- 1 pole on the northeastern boundary\n- Overhead lines running along Valley View Road (west boundary) and along the northern boundary\n\nThis means the EL-1 grouping IS APPLICABLE to this project because:\n1. Overhead electric facilities exist on or adjacent to the site (in the right-of-way of Valley View Road and along northern boundary)\n2. Buildings and other site features are proposed\n\nNow I need to systematically evaluate all 47 checklist items to determine which ones apply and which ones have deficiencies.\n\nLet me create a plan for this review:\n\n**Applicable items to check:**\n- EL-1.1: Buildings and permanent structures - must maintain 7.5-ft horizontal clearance\n- EL-1.2: Customer facilities - must maintain 15-ft radial clearance from distribution primary/neutral conductors\n- EL-1.3: Building projections (overhangs, awnings, etc.)\n- EL-1.6: Buildings relative to ROW adjacent facilities\n- EL-1.7: Surveyed elevations and locations of overhead conductors on building elevation sheets\n- EL-1.8: Section/plan exhibits showing clearance dimensions\n- EL-1.9: Fences and 7.5-ft clearance\n- EL-1.10: Fence posts and 10-ft clearance from poles\n- EL-1.18: Driveways and vertical clearance (16-18 ft)\n- EL-1.23: Clearances measured from conductor not pole\n- EL-1.37: Trees and lateral clearances (10 ft from distribution, 50 ft from transmission)\n- EL-1.38: Meter locations not obstructed\n\n\n- EL-1.40: Down guy wires conflicting with accessible paths/driveways\n- EL-1.46: 48-hour notification note\n\nI need to examine the actual plan documents to verify clearance compliance. Specifically, I should review the building elevation sheets for surveyed overhead conductor data, check the site plan for clearance dimensions, look at section/profile views for vertical clearances, review the landscape plan for tree placement relative to utilities, and assess building footprints against pole locations.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":52730,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"86ce6d80-0b13-4282-a0c1-971fcaa319e8","uuid":"48b1067b-701d-41c3-a677-1d9c055d0339"}
{"level":30,"time":1776958245568,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":9,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01C66gc8nUQ5X1eQpqLstPFE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good! The Existing Conditions Survey confirms there are overhead utility poles and lines on and adjacent to the site. Now let me check if the site plan addresses clearances from these facilities. Let me examine the landscape plan for tree placement and utility information."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":52730,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"86ce6d80-0b13-4282-a0c1-971fcaa319e8","uuid":"c55dbcd6-e45d-4ea6-bb95-fa054773e7e3"}
