{"level":30,"time":1776958245576,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0113cVikTUCYutNZB86eu1pa","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a careful visual analysis of the provided Landscape Plan (Sheet 28), here is the information requested. \n\n**Important Limitation:** This specific sheet does not label building numbers (e.g., \"Building 1\", \"Building 2\") nor does it explicitly label or delineate transformer pads (e.g., \"TX\"). Therefore, it is impossible to definitively identify a 20-foot radius from exact transformer locations. The analysis below is based on the general quadrants and edges of the site plan provided.\n\n### Legend and Plant Symbolization\nTo understand the plantings, we must first look at the **KEY NOTES** and abbreviations provided on the sheet. Specific species and individual calipers are **not** listed on this sheet; instead, they are categorized by function and mitigation status:\n\n*   **SY** - STREET YARD TREE (EXCESS OF 1.5 CAL. INCH COUNTING TOWARDS MITIGATION)\n*   **PL** - PARKING LOT TREE (EXCESS OF 1.5 CAL. INCH COUNTING TOWARDS MITIGATION)\n*   **P** - PARKING BUFFER POINT TREE\n*   **M** - MITIGATION TREE\n\n### Analysis of Requested Criteria\n\n**1. Trees/Shrubs in Proximity & 2. Species & 3. Size/Caliper**\nBecause specific species and exact calipers for individual trees are not labeled on this plan, and exact transformer locations are not shown, I can only describe the categorized plantings found in the general areas requested:\n\n*   **Northwest Area (General vicinity of potential Bldg 1):** Trees in this area are labeled with the codes **SY** and **M**. Sizes are not individually listed, but 'SY' trees are noted as \"EXCESS OF 1.5 CAL. INCH\".\n*   **West Edge (General vicinity of potential Bldg 2):** Along the western street frontage (Valley View Road)