{"level":30,"time":1776958511048,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01WXwMu9rLE3g61m9CdeVQd2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MifhoXRxNouKdYgv6JSEDi","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__vision","input":{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":31,"prompt":"Focus on the SOUTHERN PROPERTY LINE area of the landscape plan. Examine: 1) The horizontal line labeled \"OHE\" (overhead electric) - exactly where is it positioned? 2) The proposed tree symbols (circles) along this southern boundary - how many trees are shown? How close are their canopy symbols to the OHE line? Do any tree canopy circles overlap or touch the OHE line? 3) Are there any dimension lines or distance measurements shown between trees and the OHE line? 4) What labels or symbols are on these proposed trees (e.g., \"M\" for mitigation, \"SY\" for street yard, etc.)? Provide precise observations about spatial proximity."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3867,"cache_read_input_tokens":63800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3867},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f55948b1-ec2a-4bd4-944a-41435f27a914","uuid":"69b63812-8e3e-4474-b6ef-3f2a268e5d13"}
{"level":30,"time":1776958511049,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":31,"prompt":"Focus on the SOUTHERN PROPERTY LINE area of the landscape plan. Examine: 1) The horizontal line labeled \"OHE\" (overhead electric) - exactly where is it positioned? 2) The proposed tree symbols (circles) along this southern boundary - how many trees are shown? How close are their canopy symbols to the OHE line? Do any tree canopy circles overlap or touch the OHE line? 3) Are there any dimension lines or distance measurements shown between trees and the OHE line? 4) What labels or symbols are on these proposed trees (e.g., \"M\" for mitigation, \"SY\" for street yard, etc.)? Provide precise observations about spatial proximity.","msg":"Calling vision tool: 1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777 (31)"}
{"level":30,"time":1776958511049,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_015jK91YJP48pENxjtMQkVAr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015ndb7mG58oXs9vLufXmBkE","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__run_measure_distance","input":{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"reasoning":"The electrical plan shows three transformer pads. The site plan (Sheet 9) shows transformer locations adjacent to buildings, parking areas, and other site features. To verify compliance with clearance requirements in UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4, I need to measure horizontal distances from each transformer pad to: (1) adjacent buildings to verify the 5-foot clearance minimum, (2) parking areas to determine if bollards are needed (within 4 feet), (3) fire lanes to verify 15-foot clearance, and (4) other transformers to verify 5-foot separation. The site is drawn at 1\" = 20', so scaleInchesPerFoot = 0.05.","scaleInchesPerFoot":0.05,"objectPairs":[{"objectA":"West side transformer pad located in landscaped island north of Building 8","objectB":"nearest edge of Building 8 to the south"},{"objectA":"West side transformer pad located in landscaped island north of Building 8","objectB":"nearest edge of Building 2 to the east"},{"objectA":"West side transformer pad in landscaped island","objectB":"nearest parking spaces to the east of the island"},{"objectA":"Northeast/center transformer pad east of parking row serving Building 4","objectB":"nearest edge of Building 4 to the west"},{"objectA":"Northeast/center transformer pad in landscaped peninsula","objectB":"parking spaces directly west of the pad"},{"objectA":"Southeast/center transformer pad east of parking row serving Building 7","objectB":"nearest edge of Building 6 to the east"},{"objectA":"Southeast/center transformer pad in landscaped peninsula","objectB":"parking spaces directly west of the pad"},{"objectA":"West side transformer pad","objectB":"Northeast/center transformer pad"},{"objectA":"Northeast/center transformer pad","objectB":"Southeast/center transformer pad"}],"applicable_checklist_items":[{"checklist_id":"EL-13.1","checklist_deficiency_text":"Transformer pads lack minimum 5-foot clearance from buildings, structures, and building foundations"},{"checklist_id":"EL-13.20","checklist_deficiency_text":"Transformer pads lack minimum 5-foot clearance from other transformer pads"},{"checklist_id":"EL-13.38","checklist_deficiency_text":"Equipment pad installed within 4 feet of parking areas or vehicle routes lacks required 4-inch minimum diameter galvanized rigid metal posts (bollards) per AE Design equipment pad details, or bollards not spaced to allow equipment door opening"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3467,"cache_read_input_tokens":51215,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3467},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d02d4bb-637b-4cb0-b747-3ac89c84ec14","uuid":"6430cb19-8188-4610-9c5f-64470f45c17b"}
{"level":30,"time":1776958511049,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","tool":"run_measure_distance","command":"npx tsx /Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/bureau/jurisdictions/austin/workflows/review/scripts/measure-distance.ts --outputPath='/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/output/measure-distance.json' --reasoning='The electrical plan shows three transformer pads. The site plan (Sheet 9) shows transformer locations adjacent to buildings, parking areas, and other site features. To verify compliance with clearance requirements in UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4, I need to measure horizontal distances from each transformer pad to: (1) adjacent buildings to verify the 5-foot clearance minimum, (2) parking areas to determine if bollards are needed (within 4 feet), (3) fire lanes to verify 15-foot clearance, and (4) other transformers to verify 5-foot separation. The site is drawn at 1\" = 20'\\'', so scaleInchesPerFoot = 0.05.' --applicable_checklist_items='[{\"checklist_id\":\"EL-13.1\",\"checklist_deficiency_text\":\"Transformer pads lack minimum 5-foot clearance from buildings, structures, and building foundations\"},{\"checklist_id\":\"EL-13.20\",\"checklist_deficiency_text\":\"Transformer pads lack minimum 5-foot clearance from other transformer pads\"},{\"checklist_id\":\"EL-13.38\",\"checklist_deficiency_text\":\"Equipment pad installed within 4 feet of parking areas or vehicle routes lacks required 4-inch minimum diameter galvanized rigid metal posts (bollards) per AE Design equipment pad details, or bollards not spaced to allow equipment door opening\"}]' --documentId='1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777' --sheetNum='9' --objectPairs='[{\"objectA\":\"West side transformer pad located in landscaped island north of Building 8\",\"objectB\":\"nearest edge of Building 8 to the south\"},{\"objectA\":\"West side transformer pad located in landscaped island nort