{"level":30,"time":1776960414859,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01NFWcWGfSyT49j2TCAXhzhL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is very revealing. The vision analysis of Sheet 9 shows:\n\n1. **Only ONE transformer pad location is labeled on the Site Plan** - \"Transformer Pad (Typ.)\" - but Sheet 21 shows **5 transformer pads**\n2. This indicates a major discrepancy: the electrical plan shows 5 transformer pads, but the site plan only shows/references 1 location\n3. The one pad shown on Sheet 9 has a note \"need to look up approx. detail\" - which is very concerning as it suggests it's incomplete/not finalized\n4. **No dimension callouts or clearance requirements are shown** for any transformer pads\n5. There IS a sidewalk immediately adjacent to the pad (required 2 feet clearance per UCM § 1.10.4)\n6. The pad is near the property line with sidewalk easement\n7. No bollards shown or mentioned\n\nThis is creating several critical findings:\n- EL-13.1 (5-foot clearance from buildings) - Not dimensioned/verified\n- EL-13.7 (2-foot clearance from sidewalk) - One pad has sidewalk shown but not dimensioned\n- EL-13.10 (10-foot hot-stick clearance) - Not shown or dimensioned\n- EL-13.37 (Transformer pad dimensions matching AE Design details) - Not provided\n- EL-13.38 (Bollards if within 4 feet of parking) - Not shown\n\nLet me continue by checking the landscape plan for trees/shrubs clearances and then compile findings.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1575,"cache_read_input_tokens":58133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1575},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null