{"level":30,"time":1776960763585,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":31,"prompt":"Examine the landscape plan and identify: 1) Are overhead electric lines (OHE or similar notation) shown on this landscape plan? 2) What trees or landscape plants are being planted near or beneath the overhead electric lines? 3) Are tree species identified and labeled on the plan? 4) Are clearance dimensions or spacing notes provided between trees and overhead conductors? 5) Does the landscape plan include any notes about utility-compatible trees or clearance requirements from overhead lines? 6) Are there any mitigation trees being planted, and if so, what is their proximity to overhead utilities? Describe the landscape design relative to the existing overhead electric infrastructure.","msg":"Calling vision tool: 1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777 (31)"}
