{"level":30,"time":1776960768732,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_0172D9qVXxsEJ1mKjUJaz9JY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! This confirms that the plant schedule shows only minimum planting heights (16', 16', 8', 10'), not mature heights. This is critical information for evaluating EL-2.11.\n\nNow I have all the information I need to complete my evaluation. Let me compile my findings:\n\n**ITEMS TO INCLUDE IN OUTPUT (FAIL or NOT-VERIFIABLE only):**\n\n1. **EL-2.1: FAIL** - Non-utility-compatible trees (Cedar Elm/Live Oak) at 0 feet from OHE (15 feet required)\n2. **EL-2.3: FAIL** - Large trees (40+ feet) at 0 feet from OHE (25 feet required)\n3. **EL-2.7: FAIL** - Trees within 10 feet of pad-mounted equipment (0.1, 2.3, 12.3 feet at three locations)\n4. **EL-2.11: NOT-VERIFIABLE** - Plant schedule shows only planting heights (16' minimum for Live Oak/Cedar Elm), not mature heights needed to verify large tree (40+ feet) designation\n5. **EL-2.15: FAIL** - Trees proposed in prohibited clearance zones without documented Austin Energy written approval\n\nLet me prepare the structured output now.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4376,"cache_read_input_tokens":62287,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4376},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e10b0f70-f07b-46ea-a8e1-2edefb862f14","uuid":"95932070-8c1f-474a-aaf0-135905012b46"}
