 immediate vicinity of transformer pad locations?**\nThis cannot be determined as the transformer pads are not shown. \n\n**7. Is there any indication in plan notes or on the drawing of transformer pad specifications or protection requirements?**\nNo. A review of all text boxes and notes on the drawing—including the \"Legend,\" \"Tree List,\" \"Benchmarks,\" \"Curb Note,\" and \"Legal Description\"—reveals no specifications, protection requirements, or mentions of oil-filled transformer equipment.\n\n**Conclusion:**\nThis specific supplementary document (Grading Plan, Sheet 11) does not contain the locations, grading specifics, or structural details for transformer pads. You will likely need to reference a specific Utility Plan, Electrical Site Plan, or Detailed Site Plan sheet to validate compliance with UCM § 1.10.4 footnote 1.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":2715526.103504,"endTime":2743079.695377,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"G0XqaZDLN8X7idMPsat4"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.039218","marketCost":"0.039218","inferenceCost":"0.039218","input