E...`.\n*   **(d) Size/Density of Vegetation Zones:** The stippled dot pattern covering much of the ground in this area is identified by hexagonal callout **\"H-7\"**, which the Key Notes legend translates exactly as **\"SOD\"**.\n\n**3. Southeast/Center Area (General Area, east of bottom parking row)**\n*   **(a) Plant Types Shown:** Similar to the northeast, this area shows trees and ground cover.\n*   **(c) Tree Callout Notes/Species Labels:** Trees are marked with circles and category codes. A clear **\"M\"** (Mitigation Tree) code is visible on trees in this section.\n*   **(d) Size/Density of Vegetation Zones:** The ground area surrounding the trees features the same stippled dot pattern as the northeast area, labeled with hexagonal callout **\"H-7\"**, indicating **\"SOD\"** according to the Key Notes.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":6574955.840159,"endTime":6639474.720441,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"_ETqabzNOZSExtUPsaDW8AU"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.048062","marketCost":"0.048062","inferenceCost":"0.048062","inputInferenceCost":"0.