illed vs. dry-type) not specified. Cannot verify 12-foot clearance requirement without elevation details and equipment specifications."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["sidewalk locations adjacent to transformer pads"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sidewalk locations are shown on site plan and grading plan. Transformer pads not shown on same sheets with dimensions. No clearance dimensions provided from transformer pad edges to sidewalk back-of-curb lines."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.8","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["if fire exit stairwells present adjacent to transformer pads"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire exit stairwell locations not shown or identified on site plan, fire protection plan, or building floor plans provided. Transformer pad locations not dimensioned relative to building exits. Cannot verify clearances without building plans showing stairwell locations."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.9","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["if fire escapes or emergency stairs present"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire escapes or stairs serving as fire escapes are not identified on fire protection plan (Sheet 10) or building elevations. Transformer pads not shown on fire protection plan. Equipment type (oil-filled vs. dry-type) not specified. Cannot verify 20-foot clearance requirement without identification of fire escape locations and equipment specificatio