tNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Underground utilities shown on utility tap plan. Transformer pads shown on electrical plan but not on utility plan. No elevation references or vertical separation details provided at utility crossings. Over/under installations and conflicts with AE facilities cannot be determined without complete utility coordination drawing."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.27","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["overhead distribution line area on south side of site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead electric line shown on southern boundary of electrical plan (Sheet 21). Transformer pad locations not shown with dimensional references to overhead conductors. No sky-to-ground clearance dimensions provided. Minimum 7.5-foot horizontal clearance requirement cannot be verified without specific coordinate dimensioning."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.28","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["overhead distribution conductor area on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead electric line shown on site plan but transformer pad locations not dimensioned relative to conductor centerline. 15-foot radius clearance requirement (measured from conductors, not pole) cannot be verified without specific distance callouts from transformer pad edges to conductor positions."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.32","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 1"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations if oil-filled"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Grading plan (Sheet 11) shows surface drainage direction with flow arrows for all site areas. Transformer pad locations not shown on grading plan. Equipment type (oil-filled vs. dry-type) not specified on electrical plan. Drainage direction requirement (liquid flow away from buildings for oil-filled equipment) cannot be verified without transformer location overlay on grading plan and equipment type specification."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.33","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["all 5 transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pads shown on electrical plan (Sheet 21) but not shown on site plan (Sheet 9) with dimensional relationship to property lines. Plat shown on Sheet 2 but transformer locations not dimensioned on plat or site plan. Cannot verify that 100% of transformer pads are located on private property without coordinate dimensioning from pads to property boundaries."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.34","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["all 5 transformer pad locations in relation to easements"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Grading plan (Sheet 11) shows multiple easements (drainage, wastewater, water/wastewater, sidewalk, utility) at various site locations. Transformer pads shown on electrical plan (Sheet 21) but not shown on grading plan with easement boundaries. Transformer pad placement relative to easement areas cannot be verified without dimensional overlay. Written approvals from Austin Energy for any pad placements within easement areas are not provided."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.36","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["electrical service routing from all transformers to meters"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Electrical routing from transformers to meters not detailed on site plan. Transformer locations not dimensioned relative to property lines. Path of electrical conduit routing not shown with property boundary verification. Cannot confirm that 100% of electrical routing from transformer to meter is on private property without detailed coordination drawings."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.39","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["if buildings or structures installed under overhead distribution facilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Overhead electric line shown on site boundary (Sheet 21). Building footprints shown but no dimensional clearances from buildings to overhead conductor positions. Cannot verify that no customer facilities (buildings, parking garages, light poles, signs, tanks, antennas) are installed under overhead distribution facilities without specific coordinate dimensioning."}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12845,"cache_read_input_tokens":62920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12845},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01b15f0e-4ea6-438f-b485-676df5e8b514","uuid":"a9b71246-1fcc-41b1-b592-1d29aa68008d"}
