{"level":30,"time":1776961636737,"pid":43999,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Pvr5izXmYFieuaQBERf8jk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI have completed the site plan review for **Grouping EL-13: Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements** for the Valley View Townhomes project.\n\n### Research Findings\n\n**Transformer Pads Identified:** 5 transformer pads shown on Sheet 21 (Electrical Plan) at these locations:\n- Northwest of Building 1\n- West side adjacent to Building 2\n- Southwest adjacent to Building 8  \n- East of Building 4\n- Central courtyard between Buildings 6 and 7\n\n**Critical Coordination Issue:** The transformer pads are shown ONLY on the electrical plan and are NOT shown on other relevant sheets (Site Plan, Fire Protection, Grading, Utility, Landscape). This prevents verification of clearances to buildings, utilities, fire features, trees, parking areas, and property boundaries.\n\n### Deficiencies Found\n\n**5 Items FAIL:**\n1. **EL-13.15** – Root barriers completely absent despite multiple mitigation trees on landscape plan\n2. **EL-13.31** – No cross-section drawings showing vertical clearances (transformer in parking area needs clearance documentation)\n3. **EL-13.35** – Transformer easements not delineated on any sheet\n4. **EL-13.37** – Transformer pad dimensions and AE Design-approved details missing\n5. **EL-13.38** – Bollard specifications missing for transformer within parking area (within 4 feet of fire lane)\n\n**34 Items NOT-VERIFIABLE:**\nAll remaining items cannot be verified due to missing dimensional coordination between electrical plan and other sheets. Clearances to buildings, utilities, fire features, trees, parking areas, and property boundaries cannot be confirmed without:\n- Dimensional callouts from transformer pads to adjacent features\n- Access door orientation (not shown)\n- Equipment type/service type specifications (not shown)\n- Transformer easement boundaries (not delineated)\n- Cross-sheet coordination with Site Plan, Fire Protection, Grading, Utility, and Landscape plans\n\nThe submission is complete and has been recorded."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8304,"cache_read_input_tokens":75765,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8304},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01b15f0e-4ea6-438f-b485-676df5e8b514","uuid":"b24a8693-20e3-49ef-855e-6d1dd1fbddc7"}
