ed relative to conductor centerline. 15-foot radius clearance requirement (measured from conductors, not pole) cannot be verified without specific distance callouts from transformer pad edges to conductor positions."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.32","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 1"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations if oil-filled"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Grading plan (Sheet 11) shows surface drainage direction with flow arrows for all site areas. Transformer pad locations not shown on grading plan. Equipment type (oil-filled vs. dry-type) not specified on electrical plan. Drainage direction requirement (liquid flow away from buildings for oil-filled equipment) cannot be verified without transformer location overlay on grading plan and equipment type specification."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.33","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["all 5 transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pads shown on electrical plan (Sheet 21) but not shown on site plan (Sheet 9) with dimensional relationship to property lines. Plat shown on Sheet 2 but transformer locations not dimensioned on plat or site plan. Cannot verify that 100% of transformer pads are located on private property without coordinate dimensioning from pads to property boundaries."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.34","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["all 5 transformer pad locations in relation to easements"],"