out/Label:** Placed directly adjacent to the symbol is the text: **`M`**\n*   **Tree Type:** Based on the small symbol size and the key denoting `M` as \"MITIGATION TREE\", this represents a **small/medium tree**.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Plant Schedule Callouts/References\n\nBased *only* on the visual evidence within this specific provided sheet (Sheet 28), **there are no specific callout numbers, alphanumeric codes, or abbreviations that identify the exact botanical species from a plant schedule for these specific trees.**\n\nThe labels provided (`SY/M`, `P`, `M`) correspond only to the broad categorical \"KEY NOTES\" legend provided on the right side of the page:\n*   **SY** - \"STREET YARD TREE (EXCESS OF 1.5 CAL. INCH COUNTING TOWARDS MITIGATION)\"\n*   **P** - \"PARKING BUFFER POINT TREE\"\n*   **M** - \"MITIGATION TREE\"\n\nTo identify the exact species violating the 10-foot clearance, a separate plant schedule sheet or detailed planting plan sheet with specific species tags (e.g., \"1\", \"A\", or \"Q.V.\") would need to be cross-referenced.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1523,"outputTokens":938,"totalTokens":6842,"reasoningTokens":4381},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 1755680]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\nIf the requirements being validated require certain content to be present, look closely for it and provide all relevant 