ansformers to water, wastewater, storm drain, or other underground utilities (minimum 5 feet required); no gas line assessment; no cross-sections showing utility vertical relationships\n\n4. **Missing Overhead Clearance Documentation** (EL-13.27-28): Overhead electric lines shown on plans but no dimensioned clearance from conductors; no 15-foot radius clearance zones documented\n\n5. **Missing Easement & Property Verification** (EL-13.33-36): Transformer locations relative to property lines not dimensioned; transformer easement boundaries not shown; electrical routing 100% on private property not documented\n\n6. **Missing Vegetation Verification** (EL-13.13-15): Tree species not cross-referenced to ECM Appendix F utility-compatibility list; shrub/vegetation clearances not dimensioned; no root barrier details shown for trees within 20 feet\n\n7. **Missing Drainage/Grading Analysis** (EL-13.32): Transformer equipment type not specified; liquid drainage direction from pads not documented\n\n**Recommendation:** Request submission of Austin Energy Design approval documents, transformer equipment specifications, and revised plans showing dimensioned clearances and easement boundaries before approval."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6234,"cache_read_input_tokens":76339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6234},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d02d4bb-637b-4cb0-b747-3ac89c84ec14","uuid":"0c08b4f2-aa5e-4696-a550-a36e4c0b29ff"}
