,"sheetNumber":32}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Landscape plan shows tree locations and symbols (SY, PL, M, P) but does not cross-reference tree species to ECM Appendix F utility-compatible list. Tree list (Sheet 32) shows tree species and sizes but locations of specific species relative to transformer pads are not dimensioned. Cannot verify whether trees within 10 lateral feet of pads or 15 feet of overhead distribution are utility-compatible per ECM Appendix F 'UC' column."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Shrubs and low-lying vegetation near transformers"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Landscape plan shows vegetation zones (SOD, street yard landscaping, parking lot landscaping) but does not specify exact shrub planting locations relative to transformer pads or distinguish between access door side (requiring 10-foot clearance) and other sides (requiring 5-foot clearance). Cannot verify shrub clearance compliance."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.15","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Trees within 20 lateral feet of underground electrical equipment"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":32}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Root barrier details are referenced in landscape notes but specific locations and dimensions for root barriers protecting transformers are not shown on the landscape plan. Cannot verify whether trees within 20 lateral feet of underground electrical equipment have specified root barriers (4 feet deep, 5 feet from equipment)."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.21","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pads and water utility lines"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"11