ncyId":"EL-13.25","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.5.A"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pads and other underground utilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Underground utilities include water, wastewater, storm drain, underground electric, and potentially others (telecommunications, reclaimed water). Plan shows these utilities but does not provide dimensioned clearances from transformer pads. Cannot verify minimum 12-inch horizontal and vertical clearance from other underground utilities (excluding gas, fuel, steam)."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.26","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.5.B"],"applicableAreas":["Transformer pads and overlapping/underlying utilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Utility plan shows utilities routing in proximity to transformer locations, but cross-section drawings showing vertical relationships (utilities directly above/below pads or buildings/foundations over AE equipment) are not provided. Cannot verify that transformers are not located over/under utility lines or that other structures are not over AE equipment."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.27","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["If overhead distribution lines are present near site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Utility plan shows 'OHE' (Overhead Electric) lines on the landscape plan but location relative to transformer pads and vertical clearance (7.5 feet sky-to-ground) are not documented. Cannot verify minimum clearance from overhead distribution line conductors."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.28","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["If overhead distribution primary/neutral conductors